WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:02.760
With the mobile setup web page on

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.880
pictotree.eu, you can build your

3
00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:06.239
digital pictogram binder pages.

4
00:00:06.279 --> 00:00:08.400
To build a binder,

5
00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:09.880
you first start by building

6
00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:13.639
the pages of this binder using the tree builder.

7
00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:15.280
Being digital allows you to

8
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.560
put pictograms inside other

9
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.840
pictograms, creating hierarchical trees,

10
00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:20.440
which can be very convenient

11
00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.800
in many situations.

12
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.720
Here for example, we have a page

13
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.800
representing a home. The bathroom

14
00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.120
is inside the bedroom, and the bathroom

15
00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:34.080
contains several items.

16
00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.359
You can also create classic binder pages

17
00:00:35.399 --> 00:00:37.240
with standard linear layouts without

18
00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:39.080
extra dimensions.

19
00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.999
The application

20
00:00:41.039 --> 00:00:42.280
allows you to search directly in the

21
00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:46.239
ARASAAC pictogram library

22
00:00:47.199 --> 00:00:49.240
and/or upload and use your own

23
00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:52.280
custom pictograms.

24
00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:56.519
Adding images and modifying trees

25
00:00:56.559 --> 00:00:58.359
is done easily with an intuitive

26
00:00:58.399 --> 00:01:02.239
drag-and-drop interface.

27
00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:10.240
Once your trees are assembled

28
00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:12.759
and saved, you simply place them

29
00:01:12.799 --> 00:01:16.160
into the binder builder, which

30
00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:19.960
represents your complete binder.

31
00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.880
Once saved, binders and trees

32
00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:25.280
will be immediately ready to download

33
00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:29.400
directly from the mobile application.
